            "review_title": "Review at Bún Bò Hương Giang",
            "review_text": "Memises ad\n7 contributions\n0\nBad\nSep 2026 • Couples\nThe food, in my opinion, is average, nothing special. But what annoys me the most is the service attitude.\n\nWe ordered food, but the staff brought the wrong dish; when we pointed it out, their attitude was very unpleasant and grumpy. It's time to take out the spoon and throw it into the chopstick tube instead of putting it down properly.\n\nWhen paying the bill, we asked the owner about the staff's service. Then I found out that the employee was the owner's older brother. The two people were still laughing and making comments like \"this and that,\" which felt extremely disrespectful to the guest.\n\nThe owner said something like: \"If you say that, then please excuse me,\" but the tone and attitude were still very condescending, with no genuine feeling of acceptance or apology to the customer.\n\nThe food was only average, and the service attitude is like this, I really don't want to come back. Going to eat and paying money doesn't require special service, but at least one should be respected.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten September 5, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
