            "review_title": "Review at Bún Bò Hương Giang",
            "review_text": "Kate\nNha Trang, Vietnam137 contributions\n0\nOk Bun Bo\nAug 2020\nI came here with my colleagues few times. The restaurant has good parking place, convenient for both car & motorbike parking.\nThe price is reasonable for a breakfast. The Bun Bo is ok, but a bit hot under the hot weather of Nha Trang. \nAny time I came here, I saw the staff very busy for both dinning in and take away order. It means the restaurant really has a good fame for the food. U should try one time if have chance to visit Nha Trang.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 11, 2020",
